    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "不過",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "還不只是這樣而已喔！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "我要更加把勁，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "\\n讓咲戀小姐稱讚我！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "咲戀小姐總是在販賣一些很新穎的商品呢。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_6088105_001",
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "\\n看來確實有這個必要……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "好！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "\\n這就去尋找新商品吧！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "你也陪我一起去！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "你說的秀，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_6088105_002",
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "是有模特兒登場的那種……？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "那種東西跟物產展不搭吧？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "因地制宜也是很重要的懂嗎？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "你可要記住了。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "如果我跟真陽小姐一樣會搞笑的話當然沒問題，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_6088105_003",
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "\\n但我哪有她那種即興演出的能力啊。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "不、",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "美咲",
    "words": "不過我可不會因此就去拜真陽小姐為師喔！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 121411
  }
]
